# Prompt
Given.
One file folder\\mainFile.svi (having mainfile.js as a destination file)
has a link to file 'imported.svi' in the root folder 
in its 'Import prompts' section 
(the link should be relative to the referencing file, e.g., ../imported.svi).
File 'imported.svi' has the 'Dependencies' section referring 
to file 'dependency.js', but it has no destination file (just for prompt,
no generation).
Destination file is relative to the source *.svi file location.
E.g., if source *.svi is located in folder/file.svi, than destination file is
relative to the folder. Usually destination file is in the same folder as *.svi
file and thus should have no path 'Destination file' section.
When.
Run the cli.
Then.
The target file should contain contents of files 'imported.svi' and 'dependency.js'.
Also, it should contain the phrase 
"Your task is to extract all declarations from the code".

